    typeScale: 'Silkscreen sets the name, the section names and every figure a player reads off a screen: the h1 at 88px, h2s at 48px (40px, then 32px on smaller screens) with a 4px 4px 0 shadow in the surface colour, the board title at 32px, scores at 32px, counts at 56px, initials at 48px and prices at 24px, always on an 8px step. DotGothic16 400 sets the sentences, controls and labels at 1.125rem/1.7.',
