    typeScale: 'Two families with fixed jobs. Young Serif has one weight (400) and sets the studio name at up to 11.6rem/0.88, section heads at clamp(2.25rem, 4.6vw, 3.75rem)/1 with -0.025em tracking, h3 at 1.5rem, and the names of things you order (inks, papers, step numbers, days, the total). Anonymous Pro sets everything you read, type or check at 1.125rem/1.55 with tabular figures; notes and captions drop to 1rem and 700 marks buttons and the labels in ruled lists. No size in between is invented.',
